2
00:04:36,195 --> 00:04:41,255
理性の中で鳴り響く スタートの合図
The start signal echoing within my reason,

3
00:04:41,675 --> 00:04:47,055
何度だって全部結んだ 世界色付けてく ここから
coloring the world tied together time and time again, starting from here.

4
00:04:50,100 --> 00:04:55,200
かくれんぼ
Kakurenbo

5
00:04:57,105 --> 00:05:01,885
もの心付く頃 すでにここにいた
By the time I was aware of things, I was already here.

6
00:05:03,048 --> 00:05:05,048
いぜーのーで鳴り響いた
Ready, set, go! The cue signal

7
00:05:05,048 --> 00:05:07,228
スタートの合図
for start resounds.

8
00:05:07,378 --> 00:05:09,828
なぞった線で結んだ世界
The world bound by the traced line,

9
00:05:09,828 --> 00:05:12,228
色付けていくここから
I'll add color to it from here on.

10
00:05:12,528 --> 00:05:15,928
物心がつくだろう頃には此処にあった
Long before I could even remember, it was right here.

11
00:05:16,128 --> 00:05:18,828
僕じゃない誰かの記憶は夕日とともに蘇る
Memories not my own revive along with the setting sun.

12
00:05:18,928 --> 00:05:21,728
古ぼけた絵本を取り出して落書きの中に1つの答えを見つけた
I take out an old picture book and find an answer hidden within the doodles.

13
00:05:22,228 --> 00:05:24,528
自分の価値に目を疑って
Doubting my own worth,

14
00:05:24,528 --> 00:05:27,028
どこまでだって墜ちていけるの
just how far can I fall?

15
00:05:27,028 --> 00:05:29,428
どこか遠くに消してしまいたい
I want to disappear somewhere far away.

16
00:05:29,428 --> 00:05:32,028
こんな世界じゃ僕はいらない
In a world like this, I'm not needed.

17
00:05:32,028 --> 00:05:34,628
カウントダウンは始まっているよ
The countdown has already begun!

18
00:05:34,728 --> 00:05:36,978
“いぜーのーで”声上げて
Raising my voice with a "ready, set, go!"

19
00:05:36,978 --> 00:05:39,628
聞こえてくるかくれんぼ
I hear the game of hide-and-seek.

20
00:05:39,728 --> 00:05:42,228
君を見つけ出すよ 君に会いにいくよ
I'll find you out, I'm going to see you.

21
00:05:42,228 --> 00:05:45,028
オレンジ夕日 帰っていく 歌いながら
The orange sunset, walking back home while singing,

22
00:05:45,028 --> 00:05:50,728
電信柱の影踏んで 帰るふりをしていた
stepping on utility pole shadows, pretending to head home.

23
00:05:50,928 --> 00:05:54,228
得意の道草しても 人遊びして
Even taking my usual detour, playing around,

24
00:05:54,228 --> 00:05:58,228
公園貸し切り「かくれんぼ」 帰らない5時までは
the park all to myself for "hide-and-seek" until 5 o'clock.

25
00:05:58,228 --> 00:06:01,578
鬼決めジャンケン！伸びてく影 赤い鬼になって
Rock, paper, scissors to choose the demon! Shadows stretching, becoming the red demon,

26
00:06:01,578 --> 00:06:05,928
つぶした目 背中じゅうから消えてく声「もういいよ！」
eyes closed, with the fading voice from behind: "Ready or not!"

27
00:06:05,928 --> 00:06:08,628
一番近くにいる君に 一番隠してた
Being closest to you, I was hiding the most.

28
00:06:08,628 --> 00:06:11,528
一番早く見つけたくて
I wanted to find you the quickest.

29
00:06:11,528 --> 00:06:15,928
広いこの空の下 小っちさい胸の中で
Under this vast sky, within my tiny heart,

30
00:06:15,928 --> 00:06:20,228
神様だけは知ってた 照れくさかった
only God knew—how embarrassed I was.

31
00:06:20,278 --> 00:06:23,228
何より誰より隠してた 君を好きな気持ち
More than anyone else, I hid my feelings for you.

32
00:06:23,228 --> 00:06:27,278
滑り台の下の頬 影が一つ
The shadow on my cheek under the slide is just one.

33
00:06:27,278 --> 00:06:32,228
バレバレなのに見えないふり この気持ち 恋心
Even though it's so obvious, I pretend not to see—this feeling, this love.

34
00:06:32,228 --> 00:06:35,228
昔はあんなに 爪噛んだり 指を鳴らしたり
Back then, you used to bite your nails or crack your knuckles,

35
00:06:35,228 --> 00:06:38,728
今はもう君の癖さえ 過去形でも「大好き！」
and now even your habits, even in the past tense, I love you!

36
00:06:38,728 --> 00:06:42,528
どんなに遠くに離れても どんなに隠れても
No matter how far apart we drift, no matter how well you hide,

37
00:06:42,528 --> 00:06:45,728
どんなに小さく静かでも かくれてる？
no matter how small and quiet, are you hiding?

38
00:06:45,728 --> 00:06:49,528
「かくしてる！」初恋の「かくれんぼ」
"I'm hiding!" The hide-and-seek of first love.

39
00:06:49,528 --> 00:06:54,528
一番近くにいる君に 一番隠してた
Being closest to you, I was hiding the most.

40
00:06:54,528 --> 00:06:59,228
一番早く見つけたくて 遠い・おさない・想い
I wanted to find you the quickest—distant, childish thoughts.

41
00:06:59,228 --> 00:07:02,928
どんなに遠くに離れても どんなに隠れても
No matter how far apart we drift, no matter how well you hide,

42
00:07:02,928 --> 00:07:05,928
どんなに小さく静かでも
no matter how small and quiet,

43
00:07:05,728 --> 00:07:09,728
一直線で駆け抜ける君 靴擦れてただけの僕でも
Running straight ahead, you—even with just my blistered shoes,

44
00:07:09,728 --> 00:07:16,228
君の前を歩けるかな こんな頼りない僕でも
can I walk ahead of you, even as unreliable as I am?

45
00:07:37,928 --> 00:07:42,228
僕は埃をかったまま無くした
I lost it while covered in dust,

46
00:07:42,228 --> 00:07:47,228
鍵はずっと君のポケットの中にあった
the key had always been inside your pocket.

47
00:07:47,228 --> 00:07:54,228
散らばってた全てが今ひとつに重なる
Everything that was scattered now overlaps into one.

48
00:07:54,228 --> 00:07:58,228
手を取り始めよう僕たちの物語
Let's join hands and start our story.

49
00:07:58,928 --> 00:08:01,728
どんなに遠くに離れても どんなに隠れても
No matter how far apart we drift, no matter how well you hide,

50
00:08:01,728 --> 00:08:04,728
どんなに小さく静かでも かくれてる？
no matter how small and quiet, are you hiding?

51
00:08:04,728 --> 00:08:08,728
「かくしてる！」初恋の「かくれんぼ」
"I'm hiding!" The hide-and-seek of first love.

52
00:08:08,728 --> 00:08:13,728
一番近くにいる君に 一番隠してた
Being closest to you, I was hiding the most.

53
00:08:13,728 --> 00:08:19,228
一番早く見つけたくて 遠い・おさない・想い
I wanted to find you the quickest—distant, childish thoughts.

54
00:08:19,528 --> 00:08:22,528
どんなに遠くに離れても どんなに隠れても
No matter how far apart we drift, no matter how well you hide,

55
00:08:22,528 --> 00:08:25,228
どんなに小さく静かでも
no matter how small and quiet,

56
00:08:25,228 --> 00:08:28,228
ずっと終わらないから ずっと忘れないから
it will never end, I will never forget—

57
00:08:28,228 --> 00:08:30,728
初恋の「かくれんぼ」
the hide-and-seek of first love.

58
00:08:44,528 --> 00:08:46,528
もう一回 まただよ
Once again, not yet!

59
00:08:46,528 --> 00:08:49,528
泣き叫ぶ声で
With a crying, shouting voice,

60
00:08:49,528 --> 00:08:52,228
もう一回 まただよ
once again, not yet!

61
00:08:52,228 --> 00:08:54,728
笑う君が見えた
I saw you smiling.

62
00:08:54,728 --> 00:08:57,728
もう一回 まただよ
Once again, not yet!

63
00:08:57,728 --> 00:09:00,728
幕は上がりだした
The curtain has risen.

64
00:09:00,728 --> 00:09:05,728
もう一回 もういいよ色付けてくここから
Once again, ready or not, I'll add color from here on!

65
00:09:51,228 --> 00:09:55,728
暑天 作詞・作曲: 氏原ワタル
[Song: Shoten / Lyrics & Music: Wataru Ujihara]

66
00:10:03,913 --> 00:10:08,553
沈むように溶けていくように
Like sinking, like melting away...

67
00:10:08,553 --> 00:10:11,483
二人だけの空が広がる夜に
On a night when only the two of us could see the sky

68
00:10:11,483 --> 00:10:14,013
「さよなら」だけだった
It was just "goodbye."

69
00:10:14,013 --> 00:10:17,413
その一言で全てが分かった
That one word made everything clear.

70
00:10:17,413 --> 00:10:20,933
日が沈み出した空と君の姿 フェンス越しに重なっていた
The setting sun and your figure overlapped across the fence.

71
00:10:20,933 --> 00:10:29,013
初めて会った日から 僕の心の全てを奪った
From the day we first met, you stole everything from my heart.

72
00:10:29,013 --> 00:10:35,433
どこか儚い空気を纏う君は 寂しい目をしていたんだ
You, who had a somewhat ephemeral aura about you, your eyes were lonely.

73
00:10:35,433 --> 00:10:39,933
いつだってチックタックと鳴る世界で何回だってさ
In a world that always ticks, no matter how many times...

74
00:10:39,933 --> 00:10:44,233
触れる心無い言葉うるさい声に涙零れそうでも
Even when tears threaten to fall from the heartless words and annoying voices,

75
00:10:44,233 --> 00:10:49,033
ありきたりの喜びきっと二人なら見つけられる
We can surely find ordinary joy if it's the two of us.

76
00:10:49,033 --> 00:10:52,233
騒がしい日々に笑えない君に
To you who can't smile in these noisy days,

77
00:10:52,233 --> 00:10:57,233
思い付く限り眩しい明日を
I'll give you the brightest tomorrow I can imagine.

78
00:11:00,033 --> 00:11:00,833
明けない夜に落ちていく前に 僕の手を掴んでほしかった
Before you fall into the endless night, grab my hand, come on.

79
00:11:01,533 --> 00:11:05,433
忘れてしまいたくて閉じ込めた日も
Even the days you locked away, wanting to forget them,

80
00:11:05,433 --> 00:11:07,833
抱きしめた温もりで溶かすから
I'll melt them away with the warmth of my embrace.

81
00:11:07,833 --> 00:11:12,133
怖くないよいつか日が昇るまで二人でいよう
Don't be afraid, let's be together until the sun rises someday.

82
00:11:12,133 --> 00:11:16,433
君にしか見えない 何かを見つめる君が嫌いだ
I hate you when you stare at something only you can see.

83
00:11:16,433 --> 00:11:19,433
見惚れているかのような 恋するような そんな顔が嫌いだ
That look on your face, like you're mesmerized, like you're in love...

84
00:11:19,433 --> 00:11:22,533
信じてたいけど信じられないこと そんなのどうしたってきっと
Things I want to believe but can't, no matter what, I'm sure.

85
00:11:22,533 --> 00:11:26,533
これからだっていくつもあって そのたび怒って泣いていくの
Even from now on, there are so many, and each time I get angry and cry.

86
00:11:26,533 --> 00:11:33,433
それでもきっといつかはきっと僕らはきっと分かり合えるさ信じているよ
But I'm sure someday, surely, we'll understand each other, I believe.

87
00:11:33,433 --> 00:11:36,533
もう嫌だって疲れたんだって がむしゃらに差し伸べた僕の手を振り払う君
"I've had enough, I'm tired," you brush away my hand that I desperately reach out to you.

88
00:11:36,533 --> 00:11:41,533
もう嫌だって疲れたよなんて 本当は僕も言いたいんだ
"I've had enough, I'm tired," I really want to say that too.

89
00:11:41,533 --> 00:11:45,033
ああ、もうチックタックと鳴る世界で何回だってさ
Ah, look, tick-tock again, in this world that ticks over and over again,

90
00:11:45,033 --> 00:11:50,133
君の為にご用意した言葉どれも届かない
None of the words I prepared for you reach you.

91
00:11:50,133 --> 00:11:52,033
「終わりにしたい」なんてさ 釣られて言葉にした時 君は初めて笑った
"I want to end it," when I said it, caught up in the moment, you smiled for the first time.

92
00:11:52,033 --> 00:11:56,533
騒がしい日々に笑えなくなっていた 僕の目に映る君は綺麗だ
I hadn't been able to smile in these noisy days, but you look beautiful in my eyes.

93
00:11:56,533 --> 00:12:04,233
明けない夜に溢れた涙も 君の笑顔に溶けていく
Even the tears that fell in the never-ending night melt away in your smile.

94
00:12:04,233 --> 00:12:08,533
変わらない日々に出て泣いていた僕を 君は優しく終わりへと誘う
You gently lead me to the end.

95
00:12:08,533 --> 00:12:14,233
沈むように溶けていくように 染み付いた霧が晴れる
As if sinking, as if melting away, the ingrained mist clears.

96
00:12:14,233 --> 00:12:19,433
忘れてしまいたくて閉じ込めた日々に 差し伸べてくれた君の手を取る
In the days I locked away, wanting to forget, I take the hand you reached out to me.

97
00:12:19,433 --> 00:12:25,033
涼しい風が空を泳ぐように今吹き抜けていく 繋いだ手を離さないでよ
Like a cool breeze, the wind blows through. Don't let go of my hand.

98
00:12:25,033 --> 00:12:29,533
二人今、夜に駆け出していく
We're running out into the night together now.

99
00:12:55,033 --> 00:12:59,833
放っておいて育つものなんだ なんたんだろう?
Something that grows when you leave it alone - what is it?

100
00:12:59,833 --> 00:13:03,033
なんだなんだろう ももちゃん ももちゃん never never give up!
Nene, Nene, never never give up!

101
00:13:03,033 --> 00:13:06,033
ももちゃん ももちゃん never give up!
Nene, Nene, never give up!

102
00:13:06,033 --> 00:13:09,533
出会いましては簡単すぎるよ 最初にと決めた答えはひとつ
Meeting someone else is easy to do, I’ve decided the answer first at the beginning.

103
00:13:09,533 --> 00:13:11,833
ときめきました合格しますか? 恋も勝負もあわてない
My heart throbs—did I pass? I won’t be flustered in love or matches.

104
00:13:27,033 --> 00:13:31,533
コツコツコツと徹夜にため息 私の中に天才dreamer
Study, study, study and sighing all night, I’m a genius dreamer inside me.

105
00:13:31,533 --> 00:13:35,033
想うことみな叶えばいいな 他人の世界は気にしない
It’d be great if everyone’s wishes come true. I won’t worry about other people's worlds.

106
00:13:37,533 --> 00:13:42,533
Perfect-area complete! 絶対ここで待ってるんだ
Perfect-area complete! I’m definitely waiting here.

107
00:13:42,533 --> 00:13:47,033
Perfect-area 望む声が聞こえるよ あ! EAR EAR!!
Perfect-area, I hear the voice I desire, ah, ear, ear!

108
00:13:50,533 --> 00:13:53,533
Why? とまらないすれ違い 私が相談相手なら
Why? I won’t stop, and we pass each other by. If I’m your confidante,

109
00:13:53,533 --> 00:13:56,533
「友達かい?」「友達です。」 悲しき0点だね
"Are we friends?" "Yes, we are." It’s a sad score of 0.

110
00:13:59,033 --> 00:14:02,533
No! やりなおしかいなおし 本気で one more chance please
No! I’ll redo it and rewrite it. I’m serious, one more chance, please!

111
00:14:06,033 --> 00:14:10,533
いまより素敵な未来があるのに いまより素敵に my life, my life, my life!!
From now, a better future is awaiting—more wonderful than now is my life, my life, my life!

112
00:14:20,533 --> 00:14:24,033
願いましたよ月にも星にも 科学的にはどうにもならず
I wished upon the moon and upon the stars, but scientifically, I couldn’t do anything about it.

113
00:14:28,533 --> 00:14:32,033
かがやき増したあしたを夢見て 恋でガマンを学んだね
I dreamed of tomorrow, whose brightness increased, and I learned of patience with love.

114
00:14:39,033 --> 00:14:44,033
ムクムクムクと広がる雨雲 私をぬらす瞬間squall
Bit by bit, the rain clouds spread, and I’m wet because of a sudden squall.

115
00:14:44,033 --> 00:14:49,033
悩みごとほら流れたみたい 泣きごとなんて忘れようよ
It’s like all of my worries, look, are washed away. Let’s forget about our complaints!

116
00:14:49,533 --> 00:14:54,033
Passive-nature conversation! 感動したいもっとずっと
Passive-nature conversation! I want to move you, more and always.

117
00:14:54,533 --> 00:15:00,033
Passive-nature 自分次第変われるよ hi! EAR EAR!!
Passive-nature, I can change by my own choice, hi, ear, ear!

118
00:15:01,953 --> 00:16:02,783
はーいいーや、わー！
Ha-i-ya, wa!

119
00:15:03,473 --> 00:15:06,153
さりげなく聞いてみた
Casually, I asked,

120
00:15:06,153 --> 00:15:09,063
私の勉強不足で 可能性ありますか？
"With my lack of studying, is there any possibility?"

121
00:15:09,313 --> 00:15:13,053
試験は何点かな？ イェー！
"What's my test score? Yeah!"

122
00:15:13,313 --> 00:15:18,233
誰だって 君だって 巡り合う日が来るよ
Anyone, even you, the day we meet will come.

123
00:15:18,723 --> 00:15:23,183
これから始まる 季節に挨拶
Greeting the season starting from now on,

124
00:15:23,593 --> 00:15:29,043
これから始まる マイ・マイ・マイライフ！
Starting from now, my, my, my life!

125
00:15:58,157 --> 00:16:07,937
気づいた時には 生まれてた なぜだろう
By the time I noticed, I was born... Why is that?

126
00:16:08,477 --> 00:16:13,077
そうね 意識は もう育ちつつあるよ
That's right, my consciousness is already growing,

127
00:16:13,077 --> 00:16:18,857
強く 強く ねぇ！ 止まらない この気持ち
Strongly, strongly, hey! This feeling won't stop!

128
00:16:21,757 --> 00:16:23,657
まいとまらない この気持ち
My, it won't stop, this feeling,

129
00:16:23,657 --> 00:16:26,547
私の勉強不足で
with my lack of studying,

130
00:16:26,547 --> 00:16:29,447
可能性ありますか？
is there any possibility?

131
00:16:29,447 --> 00:16:32,047
それともレッドカード？
Or a red card?

